      "text": "language of my father … the learning of the Jews, 1 Ne. 1:2. Jews did mock him, 1 Ne. 1:19. spake unto me concerning the elders of the Jews, 1 Ne. 4:22. a record of the Jews, 1 Ne. 5:12. God raise up among the Jews—even a Messiah, 1 Ne. 10:4. things go forth from the Jews in purity, 1 Ne. 13:25. book proceeded out of the mouth of the Jew, 1 Ne. 14:23. he shall be rejected of the Jews, 1 Ne. 15:17. restoration of the Jews in the latter days, 1 Ne. 15:19. Christ … should come among the Jews, 2 Ne. 10:3. fighteth against Zion, both Jew and Gentile, 2 Ne. 10:16 (26:33). Jews do understand the things of the prophets, 2 Ne. 25:5. Jews shall be scattered, 2 Ne. 25:15. convincing of the Jews, that Jesus, 2 Ne. 26:12. Jews, mine ancient covenant people, 2 Ne. 29:4. Jews shall have the words of the Nephites, 2 Ne. 29:13. as many of the Jews as will not repent, 2 Ne. 30:2. Jews which are scattered … believe in Christ, 2 Ne. 30:7. Jew … them from whence I came, 2 Ne. 33:8. brethren, and also Jew … hearken unto these words, 2 Ne. 33:10. by the stumbling of the Jews they will reject, Jacob 4:15. synagogues … built after the manner of the Jews, Alma 16:13. nor make game of the Jews, 3 Ne. 29:8. Jews … shall have other witness, Morm. 3:21. shall go unto the unbelieving of the Jews, Morm. 5:14. he was slain by the Jews, Morm. 7:5. record … unto the Gentiles from the Jews, Morm. 7:8.",
